# Keep the Caisson.Api image build context small and deterministic: only src/ + the root build
# props/global.json are needed to restore & publish the API. Everything else (the SPA, tests, docs,
# infra, and all build outputs) is excluded so a stray local node_modules/bin/obj never bloats or
# poisons the image.
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
web
tests
docs
infra
reference-corpus
.git
.github
.vs
*.user
